"""Micras main board, second revision: the micromouse's MCU, 4S power, DRV8874 wheel bridges, fan
driver, sensors, ESP32-S3 radio and debug probe, and user interface.

The design is research/next-revision/README.md: its design basis (DCX 10 L 4.5 V motors on a 4S
pack with no boost; USB-C to the ESP32 only; the ESP32 replacing the HM-19 module and the SWD
connector; digital 3V3_D from the L6981C33 and analog 3V3_A from a battery-side LDO; no 5 V
rail; the STSPIN958 fan driver at 400 kHz), its recommended options and its appendix connection
lists A.1-A.6. The blocks it keeps unchanged are boards/main's, with their designators; the
parts it adds continue each series, and the designators of removed parts are not reused.

This root sheet holds the STM32H725RGV6 (IC1) with its supply network and the test pads, and
connects the five sheets:
- REGULATORS (Regulators.zen): battery input, switch, monitor (INA228) and measurement; the VSYS
  power path; the 3V3_D buck and the 3V3_A analog LDO.
- DRIVERS (Drivers.zen): two DRV8874 bridges with their shunts and chokes; the STSPIN958 fan
  driver.
- SENSORS (Sensors.zen): IMU, INA241 current amplifiers, wall sensors with their emitter
  current sink, encoder slots.
- PERIPHERALS (Peripherals.zen): buttons, DIP switch, buzzer, LEDs, USB-C.
- ESP (Esp.zen): the ESP32-S3-MINI-1 radio and debug probe.

The board is a schematic only: Project(layout = False) below. Placement and routing are
human-led and not started; the layout, its spec/main2.toml and the board's stackup and rules
(those of boards/main's Board(), the same 4-layer 1.0 mm JLCPCB stackup) come with it.

MCU supply (DS13311 Rev 5; AN5419 Rev 3, Table 2 p7-8 and Figure 5 p10, "Direct SMPS supply"),
as on the main board, on 3V3_D:
- VDD (pins 9, 22, 35, 51, 68): C12-C16 100 nF, one per pin, and C17 4.7 uF.
- VDDSMPS (pin 6) = VDD: C1 10 uF and C2 4.7 uF.
- VLXSMPS (pin 5) to L1 2.2 uH (AFE201612S2R2MBT), whose other end is VCORE; C3 and C4 10 uF.
- VFBSMPS (pin 7) and VCAP1-3 (pins 33, 49, 66) all on VCORE, with C7, C6 and C5 100 nF at
  VCAP1, VCAP2 and VCAP3. The firmware selects PWR_DIRECT_SMPS_SUPPLY.
- VDDA (pin 16): from 3V3_A, the analog LDO, through R67, a 0 Ohm link in the place of the main
  board's ferrite bead FB1 (research Power tree: its 340 mOhm DCR times the ADC current step is
  about 5 LSB at each scan start), with C10 100 nF and C11 1 uF at the pin (AN5419 Table 2). On
  this package VREF+ is VDDA (DS13311 Figures 46-47 note 1), so the ADC reference is 3V3_A, to
  which the INA241 references and the emitter set-point are ratiometric. 3V3_A starts after VDD
  (its LDO's EN is on 3V3_D), so VDDA never leads VDD at power-up (DS13311 section 3.7.1).
- VBAT (pin 1): 3V3_D (AN5419 Table 2, no backup battery), with C8 100 nF and C9 1 uF.

Pin budget (research H7 pin budget): the two pins the main board left open now carry
Motors_nFault (PC15, both DRV8874 nFAULT wire-ORed; a slow, reduced-drive pin is fine for an
open-drain input) and ESP_Flow (PH1, the ESP32's flow-control line). The ESP32 takes the SWD pins
(PA13/PA14), NRST, BOOT0 (optional, held low by R42) and UART4 (PA11 = UART4_RX, PA12 = UART4_TX),
so it costs no new pin. The motor pins keep their timers: right motor EN/PH on PA8/PA9 (TIM1),
left on PC7/PC9 (TIM3). TODO: the research's fast-ADC swap (wall sensors to PC0/PC1, currents to
two of PA6/PB1/PC4) needs a CubeMX check; until then the currents stay on PC0/PC1. PA5 reads the
battery voltage and PH0 the USB VBUS, from dividers. There is no HSE or LSE crystal.

Test pads (bare pads, not assembled): the IMU interrupts and the fan signals, as on the main
board, and the SWD backstop (SWDIO, SWCLK, NRST and GND; research Open decisions), to reach the
MCU with an external probe if the ESP32 cannot.
"""

load("@stdlib/interfaces.zen", "DiffPair", "I2c", "Spi", "Usb2")
load("./passives.zen", "C_100N_0402", "C_10U_0603", "C_1U_0402", "C_4U7_0402", "R_0_0402")

Capacitor = Module("@stdlib/generics/Capacitor.zen")
Resistor = Module("@stdlib/generics/Resistor.zen")
AFE201612S2R2MBT = Module("github.com/Team-Micras/MicrasPCB/components/magnetsyc/AFE201612S2R2MBT/AFE201612S2R2MBT.zen")
STM32H725RGV6 = Module("github.com/Team-Micras/MicrasPCB/components/st/STM32H725RGV6/STM32H725RGV6.zen")
MountingHole = Module("github.com/Team-Micras/MicrasPCB/components/micras/MountingHole/MountingHole.zen")
TestPoint = Module("github.com/Team-Micras/MicrasPCB/components/micras/TestPoint/TestPoint.zen")
Regulators = Module("./Regulators.zen")
Drivers = Module("./Drivers.zen")
Sensors = Module("./Sensors.zen")
Peripherals = Module("./Peripherals.zen")
Esp = Module("./Esp.zen")

# Supplies.
# 4S LiPo on J1: 12.0-16.8 V, 17.4 V with HV cells (research Design basis).
BAT_P = Power("BAT_P", voltage="12V to 17.4V")
# The battery after the monitor's 2 mOhm shunt: the bridges' and the fan driver's supply.
VBAT = Power("VBAT", voltage="12V to 17.4V")
# OR(VBAT, VBUS): VBAT less the B5819W's drop, or VBUS less the P-FET (research Power tree).
VSYS = Power("VSYS", voltage="4.3V to 17.4V")
# L6981C33 fixed output (DS13554 Table 6 p6: 3.284-3.346 V).
V3V3_D = Power("3V3_D", voltage="3.3V")
# ADP7142ACPZN3.3 fixed output (Rev H Table 1: 3.24-3.36 V over load, line and temperature).
V3V3_A = Power("3V3_A", voltage="3.3V")
# The ADC and analog supply, 3V3_A through the 0 Ohm R67.
VDDA = Power("VDDA", voltage="3.3V")
# USB VBUS from the USB-C receptacle: 4.75-5.25 V at the host, 4.4 V minimum at a device.
V5V = Power("+5V", voltage="4.4V to 5.25V")
# STM32 core supply from the on-chip SMPS: VOS3 to VOS0 (DS13311 Table 13 p117).
VCORE = Power("VCORE", voltage="0.95V to 1.40V")
# SMPS switching node; AN5419 Table 2 gives its range as VCORE in the Direct SMPS supply.
SMPS_LX = Power("SMPS_LX", voltage="0.95V to 1.40V")
GND = Ground("GND")
# Battery pack minus, switched to GND by Q6.
GND_BAT = Ground("GND_BAT")

# MCU signals (names as in the firmware's pin map and boards/main2/firmware_changes.toml).
RESET = Net("Reset")
BOOT = Net("Boot")
SWDIO = Net("SWDIO")
SWCLK = Net("SWCLK")
UART4_RX = Net("UART4_RX")
UART4_TX = Net("UART4_TX")
ESP_FLOW = Net("ESP_Flow")
USB = Usb2(D=DiffPair(P=Net("USBD_P"), N=Net("USBD_N")))
BAT_I2C = I2c(SDA=Net("BAT_SDA"), SCL=Net("BAT_SCL"))
BAT_ALERT = Net("BAT_ALERT")
BUTTON = Net("Button")
BUZZER = Net("Buzzer")
LED_ARGB = Net("LED_ARGB")
LED_RED = Net("LED_Red")
SWITCH_0 = Net("Switch_0")
SWITCH_1 = Net("Switch_1")
SWITCH_2 = Net("Switch_2")
SWITCH_3 = Net("Switch_3")

SPI_SCK = Net("SPI_SCK")
SPI_MISO = Net("SPI_MISO")
SPI_MOSI = Net("SPI_MOSI")
IMU_SPI = Spi(CS=Net("IMU_SPI_CSn"), CLK=SPI_SCK, MISO=SPI_MISO, MOSI=SPI_MOSI)
ENCODER_LEFT_SPI = Spi(CS=Net("Encoder_Left_CSn"), CLK=SPI_SCK, MISO=SPI_MISO, MOSI=SPI_MOSI)
ENCODER_RIGHT_SPI = Spi(CS=Net("Encoder_Right_CSn"), CLK=SPI_SCK, MISO=SPI_MISO, MOSI=SPI_MOSI)
IMU_INT1 = Net("IMU_INT1")
IMU_INT2 = Net("IMU_INT2")
ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_A = Net("Encoder_Left_ABI_A")
ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_B = Net("Encoder_Left_ABI_B")
ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_A = Net("Encoder_Right_ABI_A")
ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_B = Net("Encoder_Right_ABI_B")

WALL_SENSOR_PWM_0 = Net("Wall_Sensor_PWM_0")
WALL_SENSOR_PWM_1 = Net("Wall_Sensor_PWM_1")
WALL_SENSOR_PWM_2 = Net("Wall_Sensor_PWM_2")
WALL_SENSOR_PWM_3 = Net("Wall_Sensor_PWM_3")
WALL_SENSOR_0 = Net("Wall_Sensor_0")
WALL_SENSOR_1 = Net("Wall_Sensor_1")
WALL_SENSOR_2 = Net("Wall_Sensor_2")
WALL_SENSOR_3 = Net("Wall_Sensor_3")

MOTOR_LEFT_EN = Net("Motor_Left_EN")
MOTOR_LEFT_PH = Net("Motor_Left_PH")
MOTOR_RIGHT_EN = Net("Motor_Right_EN")
MOTOR_RIGHT_PH = Net("Motor_Right_PH")
MOTORS_ENABLE = Net("Motors_Enable")
MOTORS_NFAULT = Net("Motors_nFault")
MOTOR_L_SENSE_P = Net("Motor_L_Sense+")
MOTOR_L_SENSE_N = Net("Motor_L_Sense-")
MOTOR_R_SENSE_P = Net("Motor_R_Sense+")
MOTOR_R_SENSE_N = Net("Motor_R_Sense-")
CURRENT_SENSOR_LEFT = Net("Current_Sensor_Left")
CURRENT_SENSOR_RIGHT = Net("Current_Sensor_Right")

FAN_PWM = Net("Fan_PWM")
FAN_ENABLE = Net("Fan_Enable")
FAN_TOFF = Net("Fan_TOFF")

BATTERY_VOLTAGE = Net("Battery_Voltage")
USB_VBUS_SENSE = Net("USB_VBUS_Sense")

# MCU.
STM32H725RGV6(
    name="IC1",
    VDD=V3V3_D,
    VDDSMPS=V3V3_D,
    VDDA=VDDA,
    VBAT=V3V3_D,
    VLXSMPS=SMPS_LX,
    VFBSMPS=VCORE,
    VCAP1=VCORE,
    VCAP2=VCORE,
    VCAP3=VCORE,
    GND=GND,
    NRST=RESET,
    BOOT0=BOOT,
    PA0=ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_A,
    PA1=ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_B,
    PA2=BUZZER,
    PA3=ENCODER_LEFT_SPI.CS,
    PA4=WALL_SENSOR_3,
    PA5=BATTERY_VOLTAGE,
    PA6=WALL_SENSOR_2,
    PA7=BUTTON,
    PA8=MOTOR_RIGHT_EN,
    PA9=MOTOR_RIGHT_PH,
    PA10=MOTORS_ENABLE,
    PA11=UART4_RX,
    PA12=UART4_TX,
    PA13=SWDIO,
    PA14=SWCLK,
    PA15=ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_B,
    PB0=SWITCH_1,
    PB1=WALL_SENSOR_0,
    PB2=SWITCH_2,
    PB3=ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_A,
    PB4=IMU_INT2,
    PB5=IMU_INT1,
    PB6=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_0,
    PB7=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_1,
    PB8=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_2,
    PB9=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_3,
    PB10=SWITCH_3,
    PB12=LED_RED,
    PB13=FAN_TOFF,
    PB14=FAN_ENABLE,
    PB15=FAN_PWM,
    PC0=CURRENT_SENSOR_LEFT,
    PC1=CURRENT_SENSOR_RIGHT,
    PC4=WALL_SENSOR_1,
    PC5=SWITCH_0,
    PC6=LED_ARGB,
    PC7=MOTOR_LEFT_EN,
    PC9=MOTOR_LEFT_PH,
    PC10=SPI_SCK,
    PC11=SPI_MISO,
    PC12=SPI_MOSI,
    PC14=ENCODER_RIGHT_SPI.CS,
    PC15=MOTORS_NFAULT,
    PD2=IMU_SPI.CS,
    PH0=USB_VBUS_SENSE,
    PH1=ESP_FLOW,
)

Capacitor(name="C1", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_10U_0603)
Capacitor(name="C2", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_4U7_0402)
AFE201612S2R2MBT(name="L1", P1=VCORE, P2=SMPS_LX)
Capacitor(name="C3", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_10U_0603)
Capacitor(name="C4", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_10U_0603)
Capacitor(name="C7", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C6", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C5", P1=GND, P2=VCORE, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C8", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C9", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_1U_0402)
Resistor(name="R67", P1=V3V3_A, P2=VDDA, **R_0_0402)
Capacitor(name="C10", P1=GND, P2=VDDA, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C11", P1=GND, P2=VDDA, **C_1U_0402)
Capacitor(name="C12", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C13", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C14", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C15", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C16", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_100N_0402)
Capacitor(name="C17", P1=GND, P2=V3V3_D, **C_4U7_0402)

# Test pads (bare pads, not assembled).
TestPoint(name="IMU_INT1", prefix="IMU_INT", P1=IMU_INT1)
TestPoint(name="IMU_INT2", prefix="IMU_INT", P1=IMU_INT2)
TestPoint(name="FAN_PWM", prefix="FAN_PWM", P1=FAN_PWM)
TestPoint(name="FAN_ENABLE", prefix="FAN_ENABLE", P1=FAN_ENABLE)
TestPoint(name="FAN_OVERCURRENT", prefix="FAN_OVERCURRENT", P1=FAN_TOFF)
TestPoint(name="SWDIO", prefix="SWDIO", P1=SWDIO)
TestPoint(name="SWCLK", prefix="SWCLK", P1=SWCLK)
TestPoint(name="NRST", prefix="NRST", P1=RESET)
TestPoint(name="GND", prefix="GND", P1=GND)

# M2 screw holes to the chassis.
MountingHole(name="H1")
MountingHole(name="H2")
MountingHole(name="H3")
MountingHole(name="H4")

Regulators(
    name="REGULATORS",
    BAT_P=BAT_P,
    VBAT=VBAT,
    VSYS=VSYS,
    V3V3_D=V3V3_D,
    V3V3_A=V3V3_A,
    V5V=V5V,
    GND=GND,
    GND_BAT=GND_BAT,
    Battery_Voltage=BATTERY_VOLTAGE,
    BAT_I2C=BAT_I2C,
    BAT_ALERT=BAT_ALERT,
)

Drivers(
    name="DRIVERS",
    VBAT=VBAT,
    V3V3_D=V3V3_D,
    GND=GND,
    Motor_Right_EN=MOTOR_RIGHT_EN,
    Motor_Right_PH=MOTOR_RIGHT_PH,
    Motor_Left_EN=MOTOR_LEFT_EN,
    Motor_Left_PH=MOTOR_LEFT_PH,
    Motors_Enable=MOTORS_ENABLE,
    Motors_nFault=MOTORS_NFAULT,
    MOTOR_R_SENSE_P=MOTOR_R_SENSE_P,
    MOTOR_R_SENSE_N=MOTOR_R_SENSE_N,
    MOTOR_L_SENSE_P=MOTOR_L_SENSE_P,
    MOTOR_L_SENSE_N=MOTOR_L_SENSE_N,
    Current_Sensor_Right=CURRENT_SENSOR_RIGHT,
    Current_Sensor_Left=CURRENT_SENSOR_LEFT,
    Fan_PWM=FAN_PWM,
    Fan_Enable=FAN_ENABLE,
    Fan_TOFF=FAN_TOFF,
)

Sensors(
    name="SENSORS",
    V3V3_D=V3V3_D,
    V3V3_A=V3V3_A,
    GND=GND,
    IMU_SPI=IMU_SPI,
    IMU_INT1=IMU_INT1,
    IMU_INT2=IMU_INT2,
    MOTOR_L_SENSE_P=MOTOR_L_SENSE_P,
    MOTOR_L_SENSE_N=MOTOR_L_SENSE_N,
    MOTOR_R_SENSE_P=MOTOR_R_SENSE_P,
    MOTOR_R_SENSE_N=MOTOR_R_SENSE_N,
    Current_Sensor_Left=CURRENT_SENSOR_LEFT,
    Current_Sensor_Right=CURRENT_SENSOR_RIGHT,
    Wall_Sensor_PWM_0=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_0,
    Wall_Sensor_PWM_1=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_1,
    Wall_Sensor_PWM_2=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_2,
    Wall_Sensor_PWM_3=WALL_SENSOR_PWM_3,
    Wall_Sensor_0=WALL_SENSOR_0,
    Wall_Sensor_1=WALL_SENSOR_1,
    Wall_Sensor_2=WALL_SENSOR_2,
    Wall_Sensor_3=WALL_SENSOR_3,
    ENCODER_RIGHT_SPI=ENCODER_RIGHT_SPI,
    Encoder_Right_ABI_A=ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_A,
    Encoder_Right_ABI_B=ENCODER_RIGHT_ABI_B,
    ENCODER_LEFT_SPI=ENCODER_LEFT_SPI,
    Encoder_Left_ABI_A=ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_A,
    Encoder_Left_ABI_B=ENCODER_LEFT_ABI_B,
)

Peripherals(
    name="PERIPHERALS",
    V3V3_D=V3V3_D,
    V5V=V5V,
    GND=GND,
    Button=BUTTON,
    Reset=RESET,
    Boot=BOOT,
    Switch_0=SWITCH_0,
    Switch_1=SWITCH_1,
    Switch_2=SWITCH_2,
    Switch_3=SWITCH_3,
    Buzzer=BUZZER,
    LED_ARGB=LED_ARGB,
    LED_Red=LED_RED,
    USB=USB,
    USB_VBUS_Sense=USB_VBUS_SENSE,
)

Esp(
    name="ESP",
    V3V3_D=V3V3_D,
    V5V=V5V,
    GND=GND,
    USB=USB,
    SWDIO=SWDIO,
    SWCLK=SWCLK,
    Reset=RESET,
    Boot=BOOT,
    UART4_RX=UART4_RX,
    UART4_TX=UART4_TX,
    ESP_Flow=ESP_FLOW,
    BAT_I2C=BAT_I2C,
    BAT_ALERT=BAT_ALERT,
)

# Schematic only: no layout yet (see the docstring).
Project(name="main2", path="layout", schematic=True, layout=False)
